## A streamlined .gitignore for modern .NET projects
## including temporary files, build results, and
## files generated by popular .NET tools. If you are
## developing with Visual Studio, the VS .gitignore
## https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/VisualStudio.gitignore
## has more thorough IDE-specific entries.
##
## Get latest from https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# Build results
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# Local environment/secrets files. `.env.example` contains names only and is
# deliberately tracked; real values belong in .NET user-secrets or the process
# environment and must never be committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# ValidatedWorld transient files
#
# A canonical .vw.db is user-authored project source and may be committed.
# Ignore only SQLite sidecars and application-owned atomic initialization/backup
# files. Tests create disposable databases beneath the operating-system temp path.
*.vw.db-journal
*.vw.db-wal
*.vw.db-shm
*.vw.db.initializing-*.tmp
*.vw.db.backup-*.tmp

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# Visual Studio user/cache files
.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
